      "body": "## Summary\n\nRoute ComfyUI requests by `extra[\"comfyui_session_id\"]` so successive DiT steps stay on the replica that owns the per-run conditioning cache. Keep realtime session affinity and round-robin routing for unkeyed requests unchanged.\n\nAdd DP routing coverage asserting that ComfyUI session requests remain on one replica and do not consume the round-robin counter.\n\n## Validation\n\n- `py_compile` on the changed Python files: passed.\n- `git diff --check`: passed.\n- Targeted pytest and GPU end-to-end run: pending. The local host is Apple Silicon, and its available Python runtimes do not include pytest or PyTorch.\n- Repository test workflows are gated on the `run-ci` label; that label could not be applied through the connected GitHub integration.",
